  "sections": [
    {
      "name": "Verse 1",
      "type": "verse",
      "lines": [
        "[F]What a friend we have in [Bb]Jesus,",
        "[F]All our sins and griefs to [C]bear!",
        "[F]What a privilege to [Bb]carry",
        "[F/C]Everything [C7]to God in [F]prayer!",
        "[C]O what peace we often [F]forfeit,",
        "[Bb]O what [F]needless pain we [C]bear,",
        "[F]All because we do not [Bb]carry",
        "[F/C]Everything [C7]to God in [F]prayer!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Verse 2",
      "type": "verse",
      "lines": [
        "[F]Have we trials and temptations?",
        "[F]Is there trouble anywhere?",
        "[F]We should never be discouraged",
        "[F/C]Take it [C7]to the Lord in [F]prayer.",
        "[C]Can we find a friend so [F]faithful",
        "[Bb]Who will [F]all our sorrows [C]share?",
        "[F]Jesus knows our every [Bb]weakness",
        "[F/C]Take it [C7]to the Lord in [F]prayer."
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Verse 3",
      "type": "verse",
      "lines": [
        "[F]Are we weak and heavy [Bb]laden,",
        "[F]Cumbered with a load of [C]care?",
        "[F]Precious Savior, still our [Bb]refuge",
        "[F/C]Take it [C7]to the Lord in [F]prayer.",
        "[C]Do your friends despise, forsake [F]you?",
        "[Bb]Take it [F]to the Lord in [C]prayer.",
        "[F]In his arms he'll take and [Bb]shield you;",
        "[F/C]You will [C7]find a solace [F]there."
      ]
    }
  ]
